OL,3,GNEWSAHospice care meant 'moments of
OL,4,Aclarity' for twin
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bereaved sister has called for a
OL,7,Fchange to the funding model for
OL,8,Fhospices, saying her twin's time in one
OL,9,Fmeant "moments of clarity" before his
OL,10,Fdeath.
OL,12,FEsther Wigmore's twin Tom Robinson was
OL,13,Fdiagnosed with cancer and died in
OL,14,FNovember aged 57, spending his final
OL,15,Ftwo weeks at St Catherine's Hospice in
OL,16,FCrawley.
OL,18,FEnd of life hospice care "shouldn't be
OL,19,Freliant on charity and on people
OL,20,Frunning marathons, or whatever it is
OL,21,Fthey do to fundraise", Wigmore told the
OL,22,FBBC.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
